Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.17,1:42:27.09,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say, if we took pieces of our memories
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.09,1:42:33.31,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}namae wo tsukete hozon suru nara
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.09,1:42:33.31,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Then saved them all in the same folder{cute computer metaphors here}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.31,1:42:37.64,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}takaramono ga pittari da ne
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.31,1:42:37.64,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Wouldn't "treasure" be the perfect name?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.64,1:42:43.57,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}sou kokoro no youryou ga
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.64,1:42:43.57,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Yeah, our hearts will fill up
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.57,1:42:47.21,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ippai ni naru kurai ni
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.57,1:42:47.21,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}With the memories of
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.21,1:42:52.84,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}sugoshita ne tokimeki iro no mainichi
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.21,1:42:52.84,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Those days colored with excitement
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.84,1:42:57.94,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}najinda seifuku to uwabaki
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.84,1:42:57.94,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}The familiar uniforms, our school shoes
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.94,1:43:02.05,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}howaitoboodo no rakugaki
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.94,1:43:02.05,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}And doodles on whiteboards...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.05,1:43:06.23,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ashita no iriguchi ni
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.05,1:43:06.23,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}I guess we have to leave them all behind
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.23,1:43:10.68,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}oitekanakucha ikenai no ka na
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.23,1:43:10.68,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}{\blur5}So that we can venture into tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.68,1:43:18.38,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}demo ne aeta yo suteki na tenshi ni
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.68,1:43:18.38,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}But we did meet a wonderful angel
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.38,1:43:22.52,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}sotsugyou wa owari ja nai
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.38,1:43:22.52,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Graduation isn't the end
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.52,1:43:27.11,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}kore kara mo nakama dakara
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.52,1:43:27.11,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We'll remain friends forever
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.11,1:43:30.70,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}issho no shashintachi
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.11,1:43:30.70,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Pictures of us together
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.70,1:43:34.74,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}osoro no kiihorudaa
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.70,1:43:34.74,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Our matching keychains
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.74,1:43:38.87,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}itsu made mo kagayaiteru
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.74,1:43:38.87,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}They'll shine on forever
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.87,1:43:45.38,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}zutto sono egao arigatou
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.87,1:43:45.38,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Thank you for your everlasting smile
