Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.79,1:44:19.91,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}sotsugyou wa owari ja nai
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.79,1:44:19.91,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Graduation isn't the end
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.91,1:44:24.33,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}kore kara mo nakama dakara
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.91,1:44:24.33,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We'll remain friends forever
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.33,1:44:28.03,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}daisuki tte iu nara
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.33,1:44:28.03,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}If you say you really love us
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.03,1:44:32.05,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}daidaisuki tte kaesu yo
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.03,1:44:32.05,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We'll answer that we really, really love you!
