Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.05,1:44:36.31,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We didn't forget anything, did we?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.31,1:44:42.83,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}zutto eien ni issho da yo
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.31,1:44:42.83,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We'll be together forever and ever
